        "intent_summary": "Adds wave5_kfifo_alloc helper function to initialize the IRQ status FIFO buffer for the VPU instance.",
        "what": "Added a new function definition 'wave5_kfifo_alloc' that invokes kfifo_alloc to initialize the irq_status member of the vpu_instance structure with a buffer size of 16 integers.",
        "how": "Enables the driver to manage interrupt status data via a kernel FIFO queue by ensuring memory is allocated for the queue during instance setup."
      }
