        "change_category": "bug_fix",
        "intent_summary": "Fixes race conditions in the VPU IRQ handler by enforcing mutual exclusion and using safe list iteration macros.",
        "what": "Added spin_lock_irqsave call before list iteration and changed list_for_each_entry to list_for_each_entry_safe with a temporary pointer.",
        "how": "Protects the device instances list from concurrent access during interrupt handling and enables safe removal of list elements within the loop."
      }
