        "intent_summary": "Initialize IRQ lock primitives in the probe function to ensure safe interrupt handling.",
        "what": "Added mutex_init() call for dev->irq_lock and spin_lock_init() call for dev->irq_spinlock within the wave5_vpu_probe function.",
        "how": "Initializes synchronization primitives required for interrupt handling, ensuring thread-safe access to shared data and preventing kernel panics caused by operating on uninitialized locks."
      }
    },
