        "hunk_index": 11,
        "change_category": "bug_fix",
        "intent_summary": "Fixes driver stability by initializing instance tracking and fallback interrupt threads when hardware IRQ acquisition fails.",
        "what": "Added unconditional initialization of the 'instances' list head and conditional initialization of 'irq_sem' semaphore and 'irq_thread' kernel thread within the IRQ acquisition failure block.",
